@startuml
state "Waiting for Withdrawal Amount" as WaitingAmount
state "Selecting Predefined Amount" as SelectPredefined
state "Inputting Custom Amount" as InputCustom
state "Cancelling Transaction" as CancelTransaction
state "Returning Card" as ReturnCard

WaitingAmount --> SelectPredefined : User chooses predefined amount
WaitingAmount --> InputCustom : User inputs custom amount
WaitingAmount --> CancelTransaction : User cancels transaction

SelectPredefined --> WaitingAmount : Selection made
InputCustom --> WaitingAmount : Custom amount entered

CancelTransaction --> ReturnCard : Transaction cancelled
ReturnCard --> WaitingAmount : Card returned
@enduml
